cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Formule: archive of compound formulas searchable by raw material and product (db, 1998–2001)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "Formule is the archive of the compound formulas of a plastic-film manufacturer, loaded from the formula file of the company host system. The laboratory can look up a formula and its components, find every formula that uses a given raw material (by code or by name) and every formula used for a product, and print the formulas."
authors:
